<title>BRAZIL: Bovespa sees 681.7 mln reais net inflow in Jan.</title>
<headline>Bovespa sees 681.7 mln reais net inflow in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sao Paulo Stock Exchange (Bovespa) said it registered foreign capital inflows of 681.724 million reais in January.</p>
<p>Foreign buys amounted to 4.424 billion reais, against foreign sales of 3.742 billion reais.</p>
<p>Last year, foreign capital inflows totalled 3.379 billion reais.</p>
<p>(-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511-2485412))</p>
